DIALOGS = [
[anyone, "cpsq_sane_1", [], "It's just my upbringing. My parents paid great attention - and a large sum of Denars - to my education. During my studies, I became more and more interested in the culture of other nations. I particularly enjoyed learning languages and literature. Actually, I even attended the Marinan University of Sciences at a time, but I was kicked out along with every other foreign student when the war broke out. After the war, my father retired and I took up his mantle, learning of military affairs. The rest you know.", "cpsq_sane_2", [] ],
]
